    {
      "id": "59fcbb71-b92c-4eb7-a82d-051a6ac5dee9",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "dcd75292-832f-4da9-a5cc-78d19b49f267",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Rivet: A gear\nmoves the valve. A\nspring pulls it\nshut when power",
                "fails. A brass key\nsets the limit.\nNone is optional.\nThe old machine",
                "had a marvelous\nopening motion and\na closing spring\nborrowed to fix",
                "a musical chair."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "622a3009-bd77-4f8b-afe5-5bafd0ff2f33",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "ec2d82b6-6d56-4a9f-ab5c-1805b6ad5230",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Rivet has two\nsprings. The short\nspring closes a\nvalve that travels",
                "two marks. The\nlong spring closes\none that travels\nfour. This",
                "regulator travels\nfour marks and\nmust close fully\nwith power off.",
                "Both springs look\nclean. A trainee\nchose the short\none because it",
                "fits the tin more\nneatly. Rivet asks\nyou to explain the\nselection",
                "without making the\ntrainee afraid to\nask another\nquestion."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ae2ec44b-71af-4a4b-ae26-aab1b9967847",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "c0ee691b-a590-4aa4-a20d-e81283bfcb28",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The gears turn\nfreely in Rivet's\ngloves. Each tooth\nhas a number",
                "rather than a\ndecorative\nsnowflake. She\nsays decorative\nsnowflakes",
                "are acceptable on\nmany things,\nincluding neither\nload teeth nor",
                "safety\ninstructions. Dot\ncopies the numbers\ninto the parts\nrecord."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "eb1c4eb4-6ce0-436c-a43b-5719d15883a8",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "09a901e5-2b39-475b-a0c2-48e72956e057",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The spring sits\ninside a biscuit\ntin marked DO NOT\nEAT ENGINEERING.",
                "The brass key\nhangs beside it.\nRivet checks both\nagainst her",
                "drawing. Rivet\ntags the parts for\npublic repair and\nlocks their",
                "carrying case.\nWhatever you build\nfor yourself,\nthese belong to\nthe",
                "network."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "217a02a7-e5b0-4b48-ad81-abe5584aef87",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "53f1c3fa-db1f-4d8b-a7a3-75e1d01a64e4",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Which spring\nbelongs in the\nregulator test\nframe? Judge it by\nthe",
                "required closing\ntravel, not by\npolish or how well\nit stores. Rivet",
                "will ask the\ntrainee to repeat\nyour reason before\nfitting it. A",
                "useful correction\nshould leave the\nnext builder\nunderstanding the",
                "part, rather than\nmerely remembering\nthat a senior\nperson preferred",
                "it."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb298ddb-0e77-4fd4-a317-a9a405e7d015",
